Reuse its verified original Tencent Hunyuan brand mark, also used for Hunyuan3D.","Access type","model","access","section",[75],{"_58":76,"_25":64,"_77":78},"Motion implementation source","note","Public inference and visualization implementation with separately linked weights; no complete game project.","interactive","demo",[82],{"_58":83,"_25":84,"_77":85},"Interactive motion demo","https://huggingface.co/spaces/tencent/HY-Motion-1.0","Official text-to-motion model interface; a motion preview rather than playable gameplay. Hosted availability may vary.","tutorial",[88],{"_58":89,"_25":90,"_77":91},"Installation and motion workflow","https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/HY-Motion-1.0/blob/master/README.md","Official setup, CLI inference, local UI, and prompting guidance. Local execution requires the documented GPU resources.","Source reviewed","2026-10-18","verified","metadata","Year","2025","year","list","Tracks","ordered",false,[105],"dimensions","3D","Development stages",[109],"stages","Assets & animation","Topics",[113,114,115,116,117],"tags","Text-to-motion","Skeletal animation","Humanoid","Model weights","Local inference","Further reading",[120,121,122],{"_58":126,"_25":127},{"_58":116,"_25":125},{"_58":123,"_25":124},"HY-Motion community license","https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/HY-Motion-1.0/blob/master/License.txt","https://huggingface.co/tencent/HY-Motion-1.0","Official project","https://hunyuan.tencent.com/motion","Project source",[130],{"_58":128,"_25":64},"Why it belongs here","Tencent's text-to-motion models produce human character animation, with CLI inference, local Gradio visualization, and a hosted model demo. Use the generated motion as an animation-pipeline input and retarget it to the target character. The documented limitations include non-humanoid motion, multi-person interaction, seamless loops, and in-place animation. The release provides a motion implementation, not a controllable game character or full game project. Its custom license excludes the EU, UK and South Korea and restricts using the works or outputs to improve other AI models, except HY-Motion and its derivatives. Review the exact license and commercial threshold before adoption.","detail","guidance","Resource type","Tool","Category","Game production","category","lead","summary","name","production","tool",[156,157,158],{"_86":153,"_80":154,"_32":155},[113,114,115,116,117],[152],[151],2025,"3d","assets",{"_58":89,"_25":90,"_17":86,"_77":91},{"_58":83,"_25":84,"_17":79,"_77":85},{"_58":76,"_25":64,"_17":71,"_77":78},{"_58":126,"_25":127},{"_58":116,"_25":125},{"_58":123,"_25":124},{"_160":161},"documents",{"_162":163,"_164":165},"en",[167,171,172,173,170,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,169,206,168,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224],"zh",[166,167,168,169,170],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKILL","skills/level-design/LICENSE","skills/level-design/references/blockout-metrics","skills/level-design/ref